BT 1 0 0 1 0 32.7 Tm /F1 9.3 Tf 14 TL (Good detection logic includes a time window, a count or sequence condition, relevant context, and an exception) Tj T* (strategy. For example, many failures from one source followed by success can be a useful lead, but shared offices) Tj T* (and automated systems may create false positives.) Tj T* ET
