BT 1 0 0 1 0 18.7 Tm /F1 9.3 Tf 14 TL (Use a structured workflow: preserve the original data, filter a working copy, note the query, record counts and time) Tj T* (boundaries, and keep a path back to the original evidence. Never alter source evidence to make analysis easier.) Tj T* ET
